    "preamble": "Renati Venkata Subbaiah vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 28 July, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition Nos. 2108, 2111, 2115, 2116, 2248, 2252, 2272, 2361, 2850 and 2870 Of 2020 Common Order:",
